        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>This dataset consists of 2-5 layers solvent based glue lamination process mixture.

Lamination process realized by solvent based glues.  Solvent emissions are occured from lamination adhesive. This dataset covers machine electricity consumption, solvent based PU adhesive, solvent emissions.

A user employing this service within their models should use it along with an 1.001 kg of material to produce an 1 kg of laminated fabric. 0.001 kg of waste shall also be added. A user is responsible for defining the nature of the recycling and/or disposal of this waste. Additionally, a user is responsible for accounting transportation expenditures for all extra input and output materials that need to be modelled alongside this service.*

*Waste rate is assumed.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
